<title>AUSTRALIA: RTR-Adtrans half yr net profit eases.</title>
<headline>RTR-Adtrans half yr net profit eases.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.49 vs  3.73</p>
<p>    Net					2.03 vs  2.18</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     5.0  vs  5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Adtrans Group Ltd operates franchised motor vehicle and truck dealerships and restaurants  </p>
<p>    Sales				  182.99 vs 188.42</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.26 vs   0.39</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    9.6  vs  10.3</p>
