<p>Reg date April 1</p>
<p>    Tax					1.33 vs   1.42</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     0.95 vs   1.21</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   0.41 vs   0.36</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.13 vs   0.14</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
